{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The theme of this title is &quot;Morality and freedom&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character is a dull middle-aged man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While watching the daily news, he found an ad looking for someone to set up a venue for a magic show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He accepts the job and heads to the setup site, where he meets a shady magician...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a visual novel in which you progress through the story by reading the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a topic from the options and enjoy a conversation with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The title's play time is about 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727230?t=1751597951","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727230/beeebe99570019cdf14d97b4e37176f56e7408a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751597951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727230/0ecc5c65c755463caf7890074be75cb9734a4757/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751597951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727230/0ecc5c65c755463caf7890074be75cb9734a4757/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751597951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"d